false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-31T18:00:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T09:40:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121984","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121984.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121984.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCurrently, there is no way to visualize the audible range of an `AudioStreamPlayer2D` in the editor. The node provides configuration properties such as `max_distance` and `attenuation`, but these properties are only represented as numeric values, and there is no easy way to visualize what they actually represent in the game.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Solution\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an editor plugin for `AudioStreamPlayer2D` that provides an interactive handle for editing the `max_distance` property directly in the 2D editor, similar to how the radius of a `CircleShape2D` can be adjusted through a `CollisionShape2D`, the gizmo also draw the audible range of the selected `AudioStreamPlayer2D`, making it much easier to configure positional audio directly in the editor, also this PR introduces new settings under **Project Settings > Debug > Shapes**, allowing users to configure how the audible range is visualized.\r\n\r\n### Important\r\n\r\nThis PR only visualizes the currently selected `AudioStreamPlayer2D` node in the editor. It is an alternative implementation to another PR that displays the audible range for all `AudioStreamPlayer2D` nodes simultaneously and also supports in-game visualization through a debug option. That alternative implementation can be found [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Demonstration\r\n\r\n[The video showing the feature](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69b55078-c80a-4cfc-8025-b9a4d550760b)\r\n\r\n## Help\r\n\r\nThis PR is based on the proposal discussed here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15229\r\n\r\nIf you like the idea, please consider reacting to the proposal with a 👍.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121984/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121984/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}